OL,3,GNEWSAFreedom Festival 2026: Everything
OL,4,Ayou need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year a family-friendly guide has
OL,7,Fbeen created, which lists events such
OL,8,Fas a quadracycle performance, a puppet
OL,9,Fshow and a circus display which focuses
OL,10,Fon what the future could look like with
OL,11,Fartificial intelligence.
OL,13,FKatie Atkins, engagement producer,
OL,14,Fsaid: "What makes it so special is that
OL,15,FHull becomes like a giant stage. You
OL,16,Fcan spend a whole weekend wandering
OL,17,Fthrough the city and constantly
OL,18,Fdiscover something unexpected."
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
